    'doc.privacy.sC.title': 'If you write to us',
    'doc.privacy.sC.body': 'You can reach us at <a href="mailto:hello@orometra.com">hello@orometra.com</a>. If you write, we only use your address to reply. Please do not attach your optimization files unless you want us to look at a specific problem.',
    'doc.privacy.sR.title': 'Who is responsible and your rights',
    'doc.privacy.sR.1': '<strong>Controller:</strong> Pol Lázaro. Contact: <a href="mailto:hello@orometra.com">hello@orometra.com</a>.',
    'doc.privacy.sR.2': '<strong>Personal data processed:</strong> the IP address and basic browser data received by the host and the analytics services when you visit the site, and your email address if you write to us. Your MT5 files are never received.',
    'doc.privacy.sR.3': '<strong>Purpose and legal basis:</strong> measuring how the site is used in order to improve it, and replying to your messages. The basis is our legitimate interest (Art. 6.1.f GDPR); in the case of emails, also the fact that you chose to write.',
    'doc.privacy.sR.4': '<strong>Recipients:</strong> GitHub (hosting), Cloudflare and GoatCounter (analytics). GitHub and Cloudflare are US companies and may process data outside the EU under the safeguards they offer.',
    'doc.privacy.sR.5': '<strong>Retention:</strong> emails are kept for as long as needed to answer them and follow up; analytics are kept as aggregate statistics.',
    'doc.privacy.sR.6': '<strong>Your rights:</strong> you can request access, rectification, erasure, objection, restriction or portability by writing to hello@orometra.com, and lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency (<a href="https://www.aepd.es" target="_blank" rel="noopener">aepd.es</a>).',
